<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT WEST INDIES BY FOUR WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT WEST INDIES BY FOUR WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan beat West Indies by four wickets in the first match on Saturday of the World Series Cup best-of-three finals.</p>
<p>Scores: West Indies 179-9 (50 overs), Pakistan 185-6 (38.2).</p>
